                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A wonderful game for anyone interested in orbital mechanics.  A simple concept yet so challenging.  Great to pass the time.  If you know what a three-body problem is, then you'll love this game.\n\nSimilar to:\n\nKerbal Space Program and Osmos\n\nEdit: A builder mode would be nice.  Looking forward to seeing new features in future updates.  Keep up the great work, dev!",
